# 14. Multiple Barcodes

A variant may have multiple valid identifiers.

Example:

```text
Variant:
TSH-OVR-BLK-M

Barcodes:

8901234567890    EAN-13    Primary
012345678905     UPC-A     Secondary
TSH-OVR-BLK-M    CODE-128  Internal
```

Model:

```ts
interface ProductBarcode {
  id: BarcodeId;
  productId?: ProductId;
  variantId?: VariantId;

  value: string;
  normalizedValue: string;

  type: BarcodeType;

  isPrimary: boolean;
  status: BarcodeStatus;

  source: BarcodeSource;

  createdAt: Date;
  updatedAt: Date;
}
```

Possible source:

```text
GENERATED
MANUAL
IMPORTED
MANUFACTURER
SYSTEM
```

