# 15. Barcode Uniqueness

Barcode uniqueness MUST be enforced.

At minimum:

```text
UNIQUE(normalized_barcode)
```

unless the business architecture explicitly allows scoped duplicates.

Never allow two active sellable variants to accidentally share the same barcode.

---

# 16. Barcode Lookup

The platform MUST provide a unified identifier lookup.

Input:

```text
Search product...

[ Scan Barcode ]
```

Lookup order:

```text
Barcode
↓
SKU
↓
Product/Variant identifier
```

Example:

```text
8901234567890
```

returns:

```text
Oversized Tee
Black / Medium
SKU: TSH-OVR-BLK-M
Stock: 42
Price: ৳1,200
Store: Dhaka Main
```

