Scanning should work with:

* USB barcode scanners
* Bluetooth scanners
* Mobile camera scanning
* POS scanners
* Warehouse scanners
* Android handheld scanners
* Future dedicated scanning devices

Most USB/Bluetooth scanners behave like keyboard input.

The frontend should support:

```text
Scanner Input
↓
Identifier Parser
↓
Barcode/SKU Lookup
↓
Product/Variant
↓
Requested Operation
```

