# 33. Identifier Resolution

The resolver should determine:

```text
Input
 ↓
Normalize
 ↓
Barcode lookup
 ↓
SKU lookup
 ↓
Alternative identifier lookup
 ↓
Variant
 ↓
Product
```

Result:

```ts
interface ProductIdentifierResult {
  type: "BARCODE" | "SKU";
  value: string;
  productId: string;
  variantId?: string;
  sku: string;
  barcode?: string;
}
```

---

# 34. Normalization

Barcode/SKU normalization MUST be consistent.

Examples:

```text
trim whitespace
uppercase SKU
preserve barcode numeric value
remove scanner line endings
validate expected characters
```

Be careful with numeric barcodes.

Do NOT store GTIN/EAN/UPC as database integer values.

Use:

```text
string
```

because leading zeros matter.

Correct:

```text
"012345678905"
```

Incorrect:

```text
12345678905
```

