SkuGenerator.generate(context)

SkuValidator.validate(sku, context)

BarcodeGenerator.generate(request)

BarcodeResolver.resolve(value, context)

BarcodePrintService.print(request)
```

---

# 54. Do Not Do This

Do NOT:

* Treat SKU and barcode as identical concepts.
* Store UPC/EAN/GTIN as integers.
* Generate new SKU whenever product name changes.
* Generate new SKU whenever category changes.
* Allow duplicate active barcodes accidentally.
* Trust frontend store/vendor IDs.
* Modify inventory directly from barcode code.
* Use Redis as identifier truth.
* Use Meilisearch as mutation truth.
* Delete historical identifiers that are referenced by transactions.
* Generate fake GS1 identifiers and call them globally registered GTINs.
* Put barcode logic separately into every module.
* couple barcode generation to a specific printer vendor.

