DO NOT rewrite Catalog.

DO NOT create a second Product model.

DO NOT create a second Variant model.

DO NOT create a separate inventory truth.

DO NOT create a separate POS product database.

Reuse existing domain services, repositories, events, authorization, validation, UI components and infrastructure wherever possible.

